  "fullDescription": "Stay organized, inspired, and in control of your life with this beautifully designed 2027–2028 All-in-One Life Planner. This elegant floral planner is perfect for managing your daily routines, weekly schedules, monthly goals, and long-term planning—all in one place.\n\nWith 126 thoughtfully designed pages, this planner includes everything you need—from calendars and planners to trackers and lifestyle organizers. Whether you’re planning your goals, tracking habits, managing finances, or organizing your daily tasks, this planner helps you stay productive and balanced.\n\nDesigned in a soft, minimal, and aesthetic style, it is fully editable in Canva, allowing you to customize fonts, colors, and text to match your personal style. Simply edit, download, and print at home or use digitally.\n\n✨ Perfect for students, professionals, entrepreneurs, and anyone who loves planning their life beautifully and efficiently.\n\nThe templates include the following:\n• 2027-2028 calendar (Sunday Start)\n• 2027-2028 dated calendars – portrait (Sunday start)\n• Annual overview sheets\n• Monthly Overview\n• Monthly planner\n• 2-month, 3-month, 4-month planners\n• Monthly to-do list\n• Weekly planner sheets + checklist\n• Blank to-do list + checklist sheets\n• Important Dates\n• Favorite quotes\n• Books to read\n• Movies to watch\n• Series tracker\n• Bucket list\n• Shopping lists\n• Meal planner + recipe sheets\n• Master cleaning list\n• Online shopping list + tracker\n• Habit trackers\n• Mood tracker\n• Password keeper\n• Contacts\n• Appointments\n• Daily routine planner\n• 30-day, 90-day, 180-day challenge\n• Wishlist\n• 5-year plans\n• Priorities + matrix sheets\n• Gratitude sheets\n• Bill tracker\n• Budget overview + expenses\n• Budget sheets\n• Financial goals + sinking funds\n• Savings trackers\n\nYou can either print the PDFs as they are and start planning.\n\nYou will get 2 files.\n1 PDF file contains the Canva template. For the 2027-2028 All-in-one life planner, Fully Editable\n1 PDF file contains BASIC CANVA TEMPLATE EDITING GUIDE\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\n1. Download your file after purchase\n2. Click the link in the PDF\n3. Create a free account with Canva (if you don’t already have one)\n4. Edit the template: font, color, social media handle, and more\n5. Print at home or by using a printing service (Canva does offer to print)\n\n🌟 Here’s a quick rundown of what else you can do:\n• Canva link can NOT be resold.\n• Put your name on the product. Add your logo and branding.\n• Modify the pages.\n\nTHIS IS A DIGITAL ITEM FOR INSTANT DOWNLOAD AND NO PHYSICAL ITEM WILL BE SHIPPED!\n\nMake sure your machine is compatible before purchasing!\n\nNOTE: All printers print differently! We can’t guarantee your printer will match the exact colors you see on your screen, and we aren’t responsible if they don’t.\n\n*****Canva link with template can NOT be resold AS IS. Only YOUR OWN customized product derived from this template can be resold.*****",
